OL,3,GNEWSAHow one email turned a dad into an
OL,4,Ainternational athlete
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne email changed everything for George
OL,7,FSpencer.
OL,9,FEight years after asking how he could
OL,10,Fget involved in a sport he had watched
OL,11,Fas a spectator, the 30-year-old is
OL,12,Fpreparing to represent Great Britain at
OL,13,Fa world championship for the third
OL,14,Ftime.
OL,16,FThis weekend, he will travel to Germany
OL,17,Fto compete against some of the world's
OL,18,Fbest athletes in a sport that involves
OL,19,Fchopping and sawing through wood with
OL,20,Faxes, chainsaws and crosscut saws.
